`src/{{ project_name }}/auth.py` resolves identity:

| Context | Identity | How |
|---|---|---|
| Interactive | {% if enable_obo %}OBO — the calling user{% else %}user PAT{% endif %} | {% if enable_obo %}Databricks SDK OBO / `DATABRICKS_TOKEN`{% else %}`DATABRICKS_TOKEN`{% endif %} |
| Headless (job) | {{ headless_auth | replace('_', ' ') }} | {% if headless_auth == "managed_identity" %}cloud managed identity / workspace credentials{% elif headless_auth == "service_principal" %}service principal via `databricks.yml` `run_as`{% else %}OIDC workload-identity federation{% endif %} |

Git token (push + PR) resolution order: env var
